    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Brothers are delighted to present this truly amazing, detached property sitting in one of the best positions on the hillside in Sandycove with stunning views, it`s a house that fits into the landscape and takes advantage of the show-stopping vistas. The elevated nature of the site and southerly aspect, coupled with the mature gardens ensures amazing water views and great privacy. \n\nThis spacious home was completely renovated in 2022 and is beautifully finished with immaculate attention to detail throughout and a New England style décor which includes open plan living and kitchen space and opens to the generous sun deck making it a favourite spot to enjoy morning coffee, al fresco dining and sundowners! \n\nAccommodation extends to a floor area of circa 279 sq m (3000 sq ft) and includes a welcoming entrance hall, main reception room with the sweeping vistas and an inset wood-burning stove opening to the sun deck. The coastal theme continues in the kitchen / diningroom with a bespoke Cullen View Interiors kitchen finished in calming Farrow&Ball aqua tones with stone worktop, electric Smeg cooker and Belfast sink. Also at entrance level is guest bedroom, stunning family bathroom with unique twin wash basins, a versatile home office and family retreat featuring a home sauna. Upstairs there are three generously proportioned double bedrooms and a well-appointed shower-room.\n\nOn the lower ground floor is a self-contained one bedroomed guest apartment with a sunny livingroom opening to the gardens and patio area, kitchen, double bedroom with ensuite wet room and a second additional shower room. \n\nThe property benefits from a private walkway to Sandycove slip making it the ideal coastal retreat for those with a love of sea swimming and kayaking. \n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> breathtaking panoramic views of Sandycove and Sandycove Island </li><li> 5 bedroomed detached property </li><li> self-contained one-bedroom guest apartment </li><li> private walkway leading directly to the Sandycove slip for swimming and kayaking. </li><li> New England style décor with open plan living and kitchen space </li><li> generous sun deck for al fresco dining </li><li> extensively renovated in 2022</li></ul>"
      },
